WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.784
The next day was windy.

2
00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:21.053
The wind was strong.

3
00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.969
"Yay!" said Pig.

4
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:34.069
"I will fly my kite today."

5
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:38.942
Pig ran with the kite.

6
00:00:38.943 --> 00:00:44.808
The kite went up, up, up.

7
00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:49.198
The kite flew in the sky.

8
00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:52.835
Pig pulled the string.

9
00:00:52.836 --> 00:00:55.814
The kite turned.

10
00:00:55.815 --> 00:00:58.921
Pig pulled the string again.

11
00:00:58.922 --> 00:01:01.820
The kite did a big loop.

12
00:01:01.821 --> 00:01:06.466
"This is so much fun," said Pig.

13
00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:10.744
"I will fly my kite all day!"

14
00:01:10.745 --> 00:01:16.451
"Wow," said Bat.

15
00:01:16.452 --> 00:01:21.320
"Look out for the tree," said Cow.

16
00:01:21.321 --> 00:01:24.281
Pig pulled the string again.

17
00:01:24.282 --> 00:01:27.594
The kite did another loop.

18
00:01:27.595 --> 00:01:31.633
"You're very good at that," said Cat.

19
00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:35.078
"Thank you," said Pig.

20
00:01:35.079 --> 00:01:37.799
He pulled the string again.

21
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.484
The kite swooped up.

22
00:01:40.485 --> 00:01:43.068
The kite swooped down.

23
00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:50.940
The kite crashed into the tree.

